~ teto
if get_fact("teto.evicted")
	=> teto_after_eviction
if not get_fact("teto.met")
	=> teto_witness_intake
if get_opinion("teto") <= -3
	Teto: You. [wait=0.8] I measured you while you slept. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_3eda8d]
elif get_opinion("teto") < 0
	% Teto: Oh. You came back. [wait=0.5] I did not leave the light on for you. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_ae46fa]
	% Teto: Further away. [wait=0.8] Further than that. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]you are not moving. why are you not moving.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_69b3e8]
elif get_opinion("teto") == 0
	% Teto: Witness. Still seeing nothing? Good. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_2dff95]
	% Teto: You again. Sit, if you want. [wait=0.6] Not there. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_de92f0]
elif get_opinion("teto") >= 4
	if not get_fact("teto.told_april")
		$> set_fact("teto.told_april")
		$> add_debt("teto", 1)
		## hearing it adds 1 debt. she never says so.
		Teto: Can I tell you something? It is not on the test. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_2a4fb5]
		Teto: The day after my birthday I waited by the phone. They said it was only for one day. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e328e4]
		Teto: Nobody called to say it was over. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_d214de]
	else
		% Teto: Stay a bit. You do not have to talk. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_b2a376]
		% Teto: You came back. [wait=0.6] I was not sure you would. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4b5640]
else
	% Teto: There you are. You took your time. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_842cbe]
	% Teto: [rainbow sat=1]Hi! Hi![/rainbow] [wait=1.0] [color=#777]you did not say hi back.[/color] The others stopped coming. You will keep coming. Right? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_96240d]
if get_favor("teto") + get_debt("teto") > 0
	Teto: [color=#777]ledger // she owes you {{get_favor("teto")}} // you owe her {{get_debt("teto")}}[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_d49658]
=> teto_choose_topic


~ teto_witness_intake
$> set_fact("teto.met")
% Teto: You are loud. I heard you from the bins. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_22af1f]
% Teto: Oh. You stepped on the loose board. [wait=0.6] Everyone steps on the loose board. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_9b388e]
% Teto: Shhh. [wait=0.6] She just fell asleep. Do not make me start over. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_fe7ad6]
Teto: [b]FORM 31-B[/b] [color=#777]// witness intake // copy 4 of 4 // help help help help help help[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_a6cde2]
Teto: I ask and you answer. [color=#a33]I have the answer sheet right here, so do not bother lying.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_315089]
Teto: [b]Question one.[/b] What did you see? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c693a0]
- Nothing. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_815681]
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: Good! Say it just like that if anyone asks. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_81c70c]
- A woman with a very large bag. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_6b7ff6]
	Teto: A large bag. [wait=0.8] And how tall was she? [wait=0.6] [color=#777]you did not say. i am writing something down anyway.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f1d2b6]
- Teto kidnapping Miku. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_d9238d]
	=>< teto_punish_wrong_answer
	Teto: Look at the wall instead. Grey, with a crack near the top. [color=#777]describe the wall to me until you believe it.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4e44a5]
Teto: [b]Question two.[/b] The bag. [wait=0.8] Is it moving? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_14d42b]
- No. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_cca24b]
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: NO! [wait=0.4] Why are you still looking at it?! [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1d2543]
- Its breathing. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_d62cc9]
	=>< teto_punish_wrong_answer
	Teto: That is you. Hold your breath. [wait=1.2] [shake rate=6 level=3]See?[/shake] It stopped. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_8f86e7]
- Can I see inside? [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_8656a0]
	$> add_sanity(-10)
	She holds it open. It is dark in there, and much bigger than the bag. [#sanity_glitch] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_5a69f6]
	Teto: Okay. That is enough looking. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_588864]
Teto: [b]Question three.[/b] The bonus round! [color=#777]after this one you can go home. do you remember which way home is?[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_2aba95]
=> teto_ask_random_exam_question


~ teto_choose_topic
- What is in the bag? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_5e2978]
	=> teto_ask_about_bag
- Spend a favor. Bread. [if get_favor("teto") >= 1 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_fd2e27]
	if give_item("bread")
		$> add_favor("teto", -1)
		Teto: Here. I owe you {{get_favor("teto")}}. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0fe3f9]
	else
		Teto: Your hands are full. [color=#777]put something down. i will look after it, with the other things people put down back here.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_b5b56e]
	=> teto_choose_topic
- Borrow bread. [if get_debt("teto") < 3 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1623a9]
	if give_item("bread")
		$> add_debt("teto", 1)
		## she never collects.
		Teto: Take it. You owe me {{get_debt("teto")}}. [color=#777]i will not ask for it back.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_406426]
	else
		Teto: You cannot carry more. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_9a824a]
	=> teto_choose_topic
- Pay her back with bread. [if get_debt("teto") >= 1 and has_item("bread") /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_aadfe7]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> add_debt("teto", -1)
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: Returned. I will keep it next to her, so she knows you were here. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0cff51]
	=> teto_choose_topic
- Retake the exam. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_205e50]
	=> teto_ask_random_exam_question
- Say her name. [if get_opinion("teto") >= 3 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_267f9e]
	=> teto_say_her_name
- [[Miku?|Hatsune Miku?|Miku, are you in there?]] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_73ad15]
	=>< teto_punish_wrong_answer
	Teto: There is nobody in the bag [wait=0.8] who answers to that anymore. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_611540]
	=> teto_choose_topic
- Leave. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_6a9e79]
	% Teto: Walk normally. [color=#777]people can tell from how you walk when you have seen something.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_66f261]
	% Teto: Bye bye! Do not look back. [wait=1.5] [shake rate=8 level=3]You looked back.[/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_7cf797]
	% Teto: Go on, then. [wait=1.0] Go on. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_133c4f]
	=> END


~ teto_ask_about_bag
match get_fact("teto.bag_lore", 0)
	when 0
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 1)
		Teto: Groceries. [wait=0.8] Do not look at me like that. It is groceries. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4b2440]
	when 1
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 2)
		Teto: I keep it cold, like milk. [color=#777]she stopped kicking at 3 am. that means she is resting.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_06fa7c]
	when 2
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 3)
		$> add_sanity(-5)
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] She got a whole season. People said her name and meant it. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e06d4a]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] I was a joke. April 1st. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_a1f64a]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] Nobody came to see me off. [wait=1.0] So I kept her, to see how it is done. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_2c8d37]
	when 3
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 4)
		$> add_sanity(-10)
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] So I practice at night. Her voice is easy. 
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] The hard part is the face people make when they hear it.
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] Yesterday a man called me by her name. [wait=1.0] I did not correct him.
		Teto: Do not tell her I said that. [wait=0.8] She thinks I am the one in the bag.
	else
		Teto: Stop. [wait=1.0] [color=#777]Please.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_32f26f]
=> teto_choose_topic


